    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "You must define the layout of this descriptor as one of either:",
      "ko": "이 디스크립터의 레이아웃은 다음 두 가지 중 하나로 정의해야 합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "ff7f3842cc27e8583da0cc60ad22503f636ca7a3ebbf7ae2ebad0ae422587185",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "[`BNNSDataLayoutSNE`](bnnsdatalayoutsne.md) with the shape (num_directions*[`hidden_size`](bnnslayerparameterslstm/hidden_size.md),[`batch_size`](bnnslayerparameterslstm/batch_size.md),[`seq_len`](bnnslayerparameterslstm/seq_len.md))",
      "ko": "`[`BNNSDataLayoutSNE``](bnnsdatalayoutsne.md)의 모양이 (`num_directions*[`hidden_size`](bnnslayerparameterslstm/hidden_size.md)`,`[`batch_size`](bnnslayerparameterslstm/batch_size.md)`,`[`seq_len`](bnnslayerparameterslstm/seq_len.md))인 형식으로 사용합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "206a2c7207ccb01ed71a430de77d97fbfef280a955404b01499f52225d6bd3b0",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:discussion:0009:0002",
      "source": "[`BNNSDataLayoutNSE`](bnnsdatalayoutnse.md) with the shape (num_directions*[`hidden_size`](bnnslayerparameterslstm/hidden_size.md),[`seq_len`](bnnslayerparameterslstm/seq_len.md),[`batch_size`](bnnslayerparameterslstm/batch_size.md))",
      "ko": "`[`BNNSDataLayoutNSE``](bnnsdatalayoutnse.md)의 모양이 (`num_directions*[`hidden_size`](bnnslayerparameterslstm/hidden_size.md)`,`[`seq_len`](bnnslayerparameterslstm/seq_len.md)`,`[`batch_size`](bnnslayerparameterslstm/batch_size.md))인 형식으로 사용합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "5100a017188f88f6e59631b6c55ccc248195fe91df70f3118b9387376bf466da",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "BNNS can upack the first dimension as a 2D array with [`hidden_size`](bnnslayerparameterslstm/hidden_size.md) as the major dimension.",
      "ko": "BNNS는 첫 번째 차원을 주요 차원으로 [`hidden_size`](bnnslayerparameterslstm/hidden_size.md)를 사용해 2D 배열로 해석할 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "e8f45faddcf9a8a50948aa04c2946d1c28058284c50b3518e6a8b55a8f16600e",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0002",
      "source": "That is, BNNS can interpret the dimension as a C array with the shape `[num_directions][` [`hidden_size`](bnnslayerparameterslstm/hidden_size.md) `]`.",
      "ko": "즉, BNNS는 차원을 형상 `[num_directions][` [`hidden_size`](bnnslayerparameterslstm/hidden_size.md) `]`의 C 배열로 해석할 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "786433c0cd6880c9d6d5d322c9c32f06da4cae5d55daffcc513237fb39d6a3fc",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0011:0001",
      "source": "If [`lstm_flags`](bnnslayerparameterslstm/lstm_flags.md) includes [`BNNSLayerFlagsLSTMBidirectional`](bnnslayerflagslstmbidirectional.md), BNNS defines `num_directions` as `2`, or otherwise `1`.",
      "ko": "[`lstm_flags`](bnnslayerparameterslstm/lstm_flags.md)에 [`BNNSLayerFlagsLSTMBidirectional`](bnnslayerflagslstmbidirectional.md)가 포함된 경우, BNNS는 `num_directions`를 `2`로 정의하고, 그렇지 않으면 `1`로 정의합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "8f47a79913a24d109a469433d044ab42280bb5c0e51f84c9d5d1155ad8e12122",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0012:0001",
      "source": "If you don’t specify a layout, BNNS uses [`BNNSDataLayoutSNE`](bnnsdatalayoutsne.md).",
      "ko": "레이아웃을 지정하지 않으면 BNNS는 [`BNNSDataLayoutSNE`](bnnsdatalayoutsne.md)을 사용합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "f222e0f8850868c2969823b6da009efb1ebff0d2482cc2c572736db29bc658c2",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0013:0001",
      "source": "Use C style multidimensional array notation to define the hierarchy of the [`hidden_desc`](bnnslstmdatadescriptor/hidden_desc.md) and [`cell_state_desc`](bnnslstmdatadescriptor/cell_state_desc.md) descriptors as `[num_layers][num_directions][batch_size][hidden_size]`.",
      "ko": "`[`hidden_desc`](bnnslstmdatadescriptor/hidden_desc.md)` 및 `[`cell_state_desc`](bnnslstmdatadescriptor/cell_state_desc.md)` 디스크립터의 계층은 C 스타일 다차원 배열 표기법으로 `[num_layers][num_directions][batch_size][hidden_size]`처럼 정의합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "c144228e114f06c02cf9bfb6c10024b03ef26864975137987128e6219218bc0b",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
